==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Saber Alter (Enemy)|Saber Alter]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 100~103.33 seconds<sup>3,000f~3,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 106.67~110 seconds<sup>3,200f~3,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
After dealing with the starting peons, its very easy to stack rushers on Saber, who spawns with no support, and take her out immediately.

Rushers and high damage dealers like talented Awakened Bahamut, Fishman and Can Can can be used to great effect. Iron Cat excells here, weakening and blocking Saber's waves, effectively quatering her damage. This enables rebound units such as Awakened Bahamut to attack more regularly, killing her even faster.

